## Node
node_modules/

## Everything the client build (Client/) writes into the project's wwwroot. Both folders are
## generated in their entirety; the only tracked file under App_Plugins is umbraco-package.json,
## which is hand written and sits above them.
##
## Because these are generated and ignored, a build that has not run the client build produces a
## package that installs cleanly and then does nothing. The csproj fails the pack in that case
## rather than shipping one - see the VerifySignatureFieldAssets target.
src/Integrious.Umbraco.Forms.SignatureField/wwwroot/App_Plugins/UmbracoFormsSignatureField/BackOffice/
src/Integrious.Umbraco.Forms.SignatureField/wwwroot/App_Plugins/UmbracoFormsSignatureField/FrontEnd/
